  "scope": "Assigned Unicode 18 Jurchen, Tangut, 29 standalone Arabic honorific symbols, two baseline symbols, 15 combining marks and 22 crown letters. Direct author source under font-specific OFL. Marks and crowns are consumed only by the Scheherazade attachment/joining builder. Unassigned/draft mappings remain excluded. Historical/linguistic accuracy and custom visual treatment are provisional. Additional assigned Armenian, Greek, Hiragana, Katakana, Khitan_Small_Script characters retain native shapes and spacing; custom visual and linguistic review remains provisional. Assigned standalone mathematical, musical, geometric and punctuation symbols are lightly ink-adapted. New combining musical and script marks remain excluded pending attachment work. Hebrew U+05C8/U+05C9 are consumed only by the native Rashi attachment builder.",
